""## Lesson 2: Core Components of RAG""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""# Core Components of RAG Systems""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""A RAG system is built from four essential components working together. Let's explore each one in detail.""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""## 1. Document Store: Where Your Data Lives""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""The **document store** is the repository where your knowledge base lives. It stores both the raw documents and their vector embeddings.""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""### Vector Databases""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
"**Popular Vector Databases**:\n",
"- **ChromaDB** - Embedded, simple apps\n",
"- **Pinecone** - Managed, production\n",
"- **Weaviate** - Hybrid metadata + vectors\n",
"- **Qdrant** - Open source, performance\n",
"- **pgvector** - PostgreSQL extension""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""## 2. Embedding Model: Text → Vector Representations""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""### Popular Embedding Models""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (384 dim, fast, good)\n",
""- **paraphrase-multilingual** (768 dim, excellent, multilingual)\n",
""- **bge-large-en** (1024 dim, excellent, English only)""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""## 3. Retriever: Finding Relevant Documents""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""### Semantic vs Keyword Search""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""- **Keyword Search**: Exact term matching (TF-IDF, BM25)\n",
""- **Semantic Search**: Similarity in vector space\n",
""- **Hybrid**: Best of both worlds in production""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""## 4. LLM/GPT: The Generation Component""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""Context window management and prompt engineering with retrieved chunks are crucial. The system combines retrieved context with user query to generate well-formed answers.""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""## Component Flow Diagram""
]
},
{
""cell_type": "markdown",
""metadata": {},
""source": [
""`\n",
""User Query → [Retriever] → [Document Store] → Top-k chunks\n",
""                                            ↓\n",
""                                    [Prompt + Context] → LLM → Answer\n",
"`\n"
]
},
